  "history": {
    "origins": "Razz is the low-only variant of Seven-Card Stud, using ace-to-five (A-5) lowball ranking. It emerged within American stud poker and became widely known as one of the five games in the mixed format HORSE (Texas hold'em, Omaha hi-low, Razz, Seven-card stud, Eight-or-better), featured in the World Series of Poker and high-stakes casino play.",
    "originCountries": ["USA"],
